    <body dur="3:30.560">
        <div begin="12.026" end="12.999" itunes:songPart="Intro">
            <p begin="12.026" end="12.999" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">Psycho<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Psycho</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">Psycho</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="13.271" end="26.490" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="13.271" end="15.601" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">널 어쩌면 좋을까<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该拿你怎么办呢</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">neol eo jjeo myeon jo eul kka</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="16.495" end="18.925" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">이런 맘은 또 첨이라<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这种心情还是第一次</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">i reon ma meun tto cheo mi ra</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="19.665" end="21.802" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">Up and down이 좀 심해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Up and down 有些严重</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">Up and down i jom sim hae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="21.616" end="23.375" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">조절이 자꾸 잘 안 돼<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是控制不好</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">jo jeo ri ja kku jal an dwae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="23.449" end="25.350" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">하나 확실한 건<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯一确定的是</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">ha na hwak sil han geon</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="25.208" end="26.490" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">I don&apos;t play the game<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I don&apos;t play the game</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">I don&apos;t play the game</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="26.895" end="39.808" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="26.895" end="29.740" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">우리 진짜 별나대<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都说我们很奇怪</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">u ri jin jja byeol na dae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="30.015" end="33.149" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">그냥 내가 너무 좋아해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是太喜欢你了</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">geu nyang nae ga neo mu jo a hae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="33.365" end="35.327" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">넌 그걸 너무 잘 알고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你又太清楚这一点</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">neon geu geol neo mu jal al go</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="35.337" end="36.839" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">날 쥐락펴락해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将我玩弄于股掌之间</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">nal jwi rak pyeo rak hae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="37.067" end="39.808" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">나도 마찬가지인 걸<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我又何尝不是一样</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">na do ma chan ga ji in geol</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="41.631" end="53.811" itunes:songPart="PreChorus">
            <p begin="41.631" end="45.859" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">우린 참 별나고 이상한 사이야<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们真是离奇又古怪的关系</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">u rin cham byeol na go i sang han sa i ya</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="46.659" end="49.598" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">서로를 부서지게<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次次击碎对方</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">seo ro reul bu seo ji ge</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="50.079" end="53.811" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">그리곤 또 껴안아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">之后又紧紧拥抱</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">geu ri gon tto kkyeo a na</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="53.821" end="1:22.103" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="53.821" end="57.491" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">You got me feeling like a psycho, psycho<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">You got me feeling like a psycho, psycho</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">You got me feeling like a psycho, psycho</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="57.535" end="1:00.761" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">우릴 보고 말해 자꾸 자꾸<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都在说我们 一遍又一遍</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">u ril bo go mal hae ja kku ja kku</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:00.980" end="1:04.977" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1">다시 안 볼 듯 싸우다가도 붙어다니니 말야<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吵架时就像水火不容 一转头却又黏在一起</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">da si an bol deut ssa u da ga do bu teo da ni ni ma rya</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:05.356" end="1:08.446" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1">이해가 안 간대 웃기지도 않대<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都说无法理解 一点也不好笑</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">i hae ga an gan dae ut gi ji do an tae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:08.543" end="1:10.804" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1">맞아 Psycho, psycho<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没错 Psycho, psycho</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">ma ja Psycho, psycho</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:11.177" end="1:14.437" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1">서로 좋아 죽는 바보 바보<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱死了对方的傻瓜 傻瓜</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">seo ro jo a juk neun ba bo ba bo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:14.765" end="1:16.929" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1">너 없인 어지럽고 슬퍼져<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有你 我会头晕又悲伤</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">neo eop sin eo ji reop go seul peo jyeo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:17.122" end="1:18.648" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1">기운도 막 없어요<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至浑身没有力气</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">gi un do mak eop seo yo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:19.079" end="1:20.375" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1">둘이 잘 만났대<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都说我们天生一对</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">du ri jal man nat dae</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:20.966" end="1:22.103" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1">Hey now, we&apos;ll be ok<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hey now, we&apos;ll be ok</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">Hey now, we&apos;ll be ok</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:22.698" end="1:36.538" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="1:22.698" end="1:25.673" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1">Hey, trouble 경고 따윈 없이 오는 너<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Hey, trouble 没有预警就走来的你</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">Hey, trouble gyeong go tta win eop si o neun neo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:25.853" end="1:27.476" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1">I&apos;m original visual<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">I&apos;m original visual</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">I&apos;m original visual</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:27.434" end="1:29.608" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1">우린 원래 이랬어 Yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们本来就这样 Yeah</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">u rin won rae i rae sseo Yeah</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:29.673" end="1:31.382" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1">두렵지는 않아<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么可怕的</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">du ryeop ji neun a na</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:31.493" end="1:32.795" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1">It&apos;s hot! Let me just hop<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">It&apos;s hot! Let me just hop</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">It&apos;s hot! Let me just hop</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:33.086" end="1:36.538" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1">어떻게 널 다룰까<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">该怎么处理你呢</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">eo tteo ke neol da rul kka</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:35.323" end="1:49.453" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="1:35.323" end="1:38.788" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1">어쩔 줄을 몰라 너를 달래고<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知所措地哄你开心</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">eo jjeol ju reul mol ra neo reul dal rae go</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:38.687" end="1:40.300" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1">매섭게 발로 차도<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算我发狠踢你</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">mae seop ge bal ro cha do</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:40.623" end="1:44.089" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1">가끔 내게 미소 짓는 널<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你也会不时对我微笑</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">ga kkeum nae ge mi so jit neun neol</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:44.728" end="1:49.453" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1">어떻게 놓겠어 Ooh-ooh<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这让我怎能放手 Ooh-ooh</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">eo tteo ke no ke sseo Ooh- ooh</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:50.164" end="2:02.533" itunes:songPart="PreChorus">
            <p begin="1:50.164" end="1:53.840" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1">우린 아름답고 참 슬픈 사이야<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们真是美丽又悲伤的关系</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">u rin a reum dap go cham seul peun sa i ya</span>
