            <p begin="1:55.191" end="1:58.056" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1">서로를 빛나게 해<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让彼此闪耀光芒</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ko-Latn">seo ro reul bit na ge hae</span>
